  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting Community-driven Violence Reduction and Sustainable Peace in Lesotho.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The primary goal of the project is to reduce violence in communities through strengthening existing community infrastructures for peace and enhancing women&#x2019;s leadership, active engagement and participation in peacebuilding and peace processes at community level. The project thus seeks to address the high and increasing levels of community violence by enhancing community conflict mitigation, prevention, and peacebuilding as part of an overall move towards building and sustaining peace in the uni</narrative>
  </description>
